;; mail — compose an email and deliver it through a swappable adapter. Ships with a local
;; mailbox (`mail/local`, with a page to read it) and Mailjet (`mail/mailjet`); any other
;; vendor is a value with an `Adapter` impl, in its own package.
(project
  :name "mail"
  :version "0.2.0"
  :brood ">= 0.29.2"
  :description
    "Compose an email and deliver it through a swappable adapter — Swoosh, for Brood. Builder, validation, telemetry; a local mailbox with a preview page and a Mailjet adapter built in; any vendor pluggable through the Adapter ability."
  :repository "https://github.com/broodlang/mail"
  ;; hatch renders and serves the mailbox pages (`web/template`, `web/conn`).
  :dependencies [[hatch :version "^0.23.0"]])
